  m_text: '7-13-26 Gavin Notes


    Please press any button and wait for the player
    join message to appear, then select Monster 1 or Monster 2. After this selection,
    you may choose where to load in the monster.


    QA Focus: animations, damage,
    and full destruction


    Changes were made to Beastdome regarding scale and
    placement of backdrop to accommodate new destruction camera. Because of this
    and the notes about its effects, the tilting stage hazard has been removed from
    the list temporarily. Destruction cam currently has no support for when players
    jump off edges'
